+# B1 C2, C3 and the criterion — 2026-09-07
+
+**C2_FLUID=PASS; C2_DIRAC=PASS. C3_FLUID=FAIL; C3_DIRAC=FAIL.**
+The overall C3 tokens require both the no-production and production checks to pass.
