+**DIRAC.** RMP (5.13) uses the fully antisymmetric spin current; (5.15) gives
+\[
+\bar\sigma_{\mu\nu,D}
+=\Sigma_{(\mu\nu)}(\{\})-\frac\kappa2g_{\mu\nu}
+ \tau^{abc}\tau_{abc}.
