+**Production, number-only insertion:** retaining \(J=0\) gives
+\[
+\mathcal R_{C,F}=2\kappa\alpha_Fn\Psi,\qquad
+\mathcal R_{C,D}=-6\kappa H\alpha_Dn^2+2\kappa\alpha_Dn\Psi.
