+| FLUID | \(\epsilon-\alpha_F n^2\) | \(\epsilon/3-\alpha_F n^2\) | \(\alpha_F=\kappa\hbar^2/32\) |
+| DIRAC | \(\epsilon-\alpha_D n^2\) | \(\epsilon/3+\alpha_D n^2\) | \(\alpha_D=9\kappa/16\), PRD's \(\hbar=1\) units |
